Server init.
>> a := Blob baru: 4.
a bytes: ( Daftar baru ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob baru: 4.
b bytes: ( Daftar baru ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a baru.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Keluaran tulis: ( a ^ c ), baris-baru. } tangkap: { :e Keluaran tulis: e, baris-baru. }, mulai.
a bebaskan.
b bebaskan.
